2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (High\040Utility\040Drift\040Detection\040in\040Quantitative\040Data\040Streams)
/Author (Quang\055Huy\040Duong\054\040Heri\040Ramampiaro\054\040Kjetil\040Nørvåg\054\040Philippe\040Fournier\055Viger\054\040Thu\055Lan\040Dam)
/Subject (This\040paper\040presents\040an\040efficient\040algorithm\040for\040detecting\040changes\040\050drifts\051\040in\040the\040utility\040distributions\040of\040patterns\054\040named\040High\040Utility\040Drift\040Detection\040in\040Transactional\040Data\040Stream\040\050HUDD\055TDS\051\056\040The\040algorithm\040is\040specifically\040suitable\040for\040quantitative\040data\040streams\054\040where\040each\040item\040has\040a\040unit\040profit\054\040and\040non\055binary\040purchase\040quantities\040are\040allowed\056\040We\040propose\040a\040method\040that\040enables\040the\040HUDD\055TDS\040algorithm\040to\040be\040used\040in\040an\040online\040setting\040to\040detect\040drifts\056\040An\040important\040property\040of\040HUDD\055TDS\040is\040that\040it\040can\040quickly\040adapt\040to\040changes\040in\040streams\054\040while\040considering\040older\040transactions\040to\040be\040less\040important\040than\040new\040ones\056\040Furthermore\054\040the\040proposed\040method\040applies\040statistical\040testing\040based\040on\040Hoeffding\040bound\040with\040Bonferroni\040correction\040in\040order\040to\040ensure\040that\040only\040significant\040changes\040are\040reported\040to\040the\040user\056\040This\040test\040allows\040identifying\040a\040change\040\050drift\051\040if\040the\040difference\040between\040current\040and\040the\040previous\040time\040window\040is\040significant\040in\040terms\040of\040utility\040distribution\056\040In\040this\040work\054\040we\040focus\040on\040both\040local\040and\040global\040utility\040drifts\056\040A\040local\040utility\040drift\040is\040a\040drift\040in\040the\040utility\040distribution\040of\040a\040single\040pattern\054\040whereas\040a\040global\040utility\040drift\040is\040a\040change\040in\040the\040utilities\040of\040all\040high\040utility\040itemsets\056\040In\040order\040to\040be\040able\040to\040compute\040the\040similarity\040of\040different\040high\040utility\040itemsets\040to\040detect\040drifts\054\040we\040propose\040a\040new\040distance\040measure\040function\056\040The\040results\040of\040our\040experiments\040on\040both\040real\040world\040and\040synthetic\040datasets\040show\040the\040feasibility\040and\040efficiency\040of\040the\040proposed\040HUDD\055TDS\040algorithm\056)
/Keywords (01\040Oct\0402018\054\040Knowledge\040Based\040Systems\054\040Data\040stream\040mining\054\040Norwegian\040University\040of\040Science\040and\040Technology\054\040Harbin\040Institute\040of\040Technology)
>>
endobj
